OL,3,GNEWSACouncil hopes training hub will   
OL,4,A'inspire' learners                     
OL,6,FA new training hub will help young     
OL,7,Fpeople and adults in Hull to gain      
OL,8,Femployment or change careers, the city 
OL,9,Fcouncil has said.                      
OL,11,FThe Centre for Learning, which is based
OL,12,Fat the former Trinity House Academy in 
OL,13,FGeorge Street, will officially open    
OL,14,Flater following a refurbishment costing
OL,15,Fmore than #5m.                         
OL,17,FAccording to the council, the centre   
OL,18,Fwill provide a "single and accessible  
OL,19,Flocation", offering post-16 courses and
OL,20,Fqualifications, as well as             
OL,21,Fapprenticeships and adult education.   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
