OL,3,GNEWSACouncil hopes training hub will   
OL,4,A'inspire' learners                     
OL,6,FCouncillor Linda Tock, portfolio holder
OL,7,Ffor learning, said she hoped           
OL,8,F"state-of-the-art training facilities" 
OL,9,Fwould "inspire" potential students and 
OL,10,Fprovide "learning opportunities that   
OL,11,Fare available to everyone of every     
OL,12,Fage".                                  
